{
  "name": "iron_armor_surface_v2",
  "description": "地表铁矿露头做铁套（ACX 移植版）：循环(刷矿情→导航到矿→挖) 直到扫不到矿，熔炼全部粗铁，合成铁套。",
  "tags": ["iron", "armor", "survival", "mining"],
  "planner_notes": "DD 原版 iron_armor_surface.ac 里 while 的子步骤又叫 scan（与顶层重名），同样靠后写覆盖让 while 条件刷新。ACX 移植版：内层改名 scan_iter、while 条件读 $scan_iter.done、加 do_while=true 显式声明「条件源由本轮 body 产生」。导航坐标用 $prev.target_absX（$prev 在 while 内指向上一兄弟步，第 1 轮自然落在进入块前的输出上），挖的方块名用 $scan_iter.target_block。",
  "safety_notes": "max_iters=24 + stagnant_limit=3 双重收场：矿挖完（scan_iter.done 变 false）正常退出；连续 3 轮没挖到东西判此路不通，PAUSED 不断言失败。",
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "check_tools",
      "block": "check_inventory",
      "params": { "check": "pickaxe,furnace,torch" }
    },
    {
      "id": "prep",
      "block": "if",
      "params": {
        "condition": { "field": "$prev.found", "op": "==", "value": false }
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "make_pick",
          "block": "give_pickaxe",
          "params": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "make_furn",
          "block": "make_furnace",
          "params": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "scan0",
      "block": "scan_blocks",
      "params": {
        "targets": ["iron_ore", "deepslate_iron_ore"],
        "radius": 64,
        "min_count": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "loop",
      "block": "while",
      "params": {
        "condition": { "field": "$scan_iter.done", "op": "==", "value": true },
        "max_iters": 24,
        "stagnant_limit": 3,
        "do_while": true
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "scan_iter",
          "block": "scan_blocks",
          "params": {
            "targets": ["iron_ore", "deepslate_iron_ore"],
            "radius": 64,
            "min_count": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "nav",
          "block": "navigate_to",
          "params": {
            "x": "$prev.target_absX",
            "y": "$prev.target_absY",
            "z": "$prev.target_absZ",
            "relative": false,
            "ignore_failure": true
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "mine",
          "block": "mine_block",
          "params": {
            "block": "$scan_iter.target_block",
            "ignore_failure": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "smelt",
      "block": "smelt_batch",
      "params": { "input": "raw_iron", "count": "$input.count" }
    },
    {
      "id": "armor",
      "block": "make_iron_armor",
      "params": {}
    }
  ]
}